Subject: [PATCH 14/37] ARM: dts: r8a7745: Add CMT SoC specific support
Date: Fri, 22 Dec 2017 11:29:52 +0100
Message-Id: <9680c97b516cbb70efe73dde05d497b1203bde6d.1513938145.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
